(1, "SmartFocus Glasses", "If You're Over 50 These Glasses Are Life-Changing", "As we age, our vision naturally begins to decline—a fact of life that, until recently, felt unavoidable.", "Meet SmartFocus Glasses—not only do these glasses provide crystal-clear vision instantly, but they're also designed to improve your eyesight over time, allowing you to enjoy sharp, clear vision without needing glasses in the future.", "❗️ We've secured a special deal on", "—click below to claim your 50% discount while it lasts! ❗️", 50, 4.8, 1, "images/smartfocus.webp", 1),
(2, "LumoNail", "The Convenient, Affordable Device Against Nail Fungus", "LumoNail - The pain-free, affordable solution for toenail fungus.", "This innovative at-home device uses advanced low-level laser therapy combined with heat to penetrate deep into the nail bed where fungal infections hide. By targeting the infection directly, it stops fungal cells from reproducing while promoting tissue repair and regeneration.", "The result? Stronger, healthier nails that regain their natural appearance. No more hiding your feet—wear sandals or go barefoot with confidence again.", NULL, 50, 4.8, 2, "videos/1758894881039_lumonail.webm", 1),
(3, "Guardian Monitor Mini Spy Cam", "The Only Way To Keep Your House Safe", "Meet the Guardian Monitor—the compact powerhouse that delivers top-tier features without the hassle of installation or monthly fees. Capture crystal-clear, full HD video with its 150° ultra-wide lens, ensuring you never miss a detail, day or night, thanks to advanced LED night vision.", "Its magnetic base means effortless setup on any surface, indoors or out—no cables or batteries needed! Monitor everything directly from your smartphone or computer with easy-to-use apps available for iOS and Android. With instant alerts and two-way audio, you'll have peace of mind at your fingertips.", "The", "is the smart, portable security upgrade that keeps your wallet happy, saving you hundreds every year.", 50, 4.9, 2, "videos/minicam.webm", 1),
(4, "SootheSmart Neck Massager", "Instantly Relieve Tension Headaches And Tight Neck & Shoulders", "Studies reveal that 83% of muscle pain and tension headaches stem from tight neck and shoulder muscles — leading to sleepless nights, irritability with loved ones, and even anxiety attacks.", "That's where Soothe Smart Neck Massager changes everything.", "Clinical research proves that targeted neck massage releases built-up tension, restores healthy posture, and brings immediate relief. With", "advanced ultrasonic pulse technology, even the deepest muscle knots melt away in minutes.", 50, 5.0, 2, "videos/neck-massager.webm", 1),
(5, "NovelSip", "The Handcrafted Glass Mug Every Book Lover Is Obsessed With", "Boring mugs are for boring people. NovelSip transforms your morning coffee into a literary experience with its stunning 3D book-stack design that screams \"I read actual books.\"", "Each handcrafted glass mug features colorful book spines that wrap around your drink. No two are identical—yours is genuinely one-of-a-kind. Holds 16oz, dishwasher safe, and guaranteed to start conversations.", "Book clubs are bulk-ordering these. Librarians are hoarding them. English teachers can't stop posting them on Instagram. Once these limited-edition mugs sell out, they're gone forever.", NULL, 60, 5.0, 1, "images/novelsip.gif", 1),
(6, "ChopWell Cutting Board", "Your Cutting Board Is a Major Health Risk", "Your cutting board could be poisoning your family's food with bacteria, mold, and microplastics—and you don't even know it. Research shows that traditional plastic and wooden boards harbor dangerous bacteria like E. coli and salmonella in their scratches and grooves, even after thorough washing. This contamination risk skyrockets when handling raw meat.", "The hidden danger? Plastic boards shed invisible microplastics directly into your meals with every cut. These toxic particles accumulate in your body over time, with health consequences we're only beginning to understand.", "Why gamble with your family's health when", "offers the perfect solution?", 60, 5.0, 2, "videos/chopwell-2.mp4", 1),
